@participant1 thanks for your quick response. Given the nature of the table, I cannot share the table schema directly. I'm using ReplacingMergeTree as the engine, with PARTITION BY toYYYYMMDD(datetime). 

I'm inserting data using .native files, through clickhouse-client command directly. Example: cat file.native | clickhouse-client --async_insert=0 --max_insert_block_size=2097152 --query="INSERT INTO <table> (<columns>) FORMAT Native"

The performance in 26.1 version is very similar to version 25.8, so it's working fine on 26.1
